<title>MALTA: Yield unchanged in Malta bills issue.</title>
<headline>Yield unchanged in Malta bills issue.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Malta Treasury will issue on Friday Lm391,000 ($1.09 million) in 91-day treasury bills maturing on February 21,1997.</p>
<p>The weighted average yield rate is 4.9974 percent per annum, unchanged from the previous 91-day issue of November 8, 1996.</p>
<p>($=Lm0.35)</p>
</text>
